        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "1. Definition",
          "ink": "green"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "An ==external store== holds state {red:outside} the React tree. Components __subscribe__ to it; React is a reader, not the owner.",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "green"
        },
        {
          "type": "sidebox",
          "title": "The five signals",
          "items": [
            "**1** Same state read by ==distant, unrelated subtrees==",
            "**2** ==High-frequency== updates, many consumers",
            "**3** Need ==selector== subscriptions per field",
            "**4** State lives ==outside React== (socket, worker)",
            "**5** Need ==time-travel==, persistence, action log"
          ],
          "ink": "purple"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Signal 1: lifting means hoisting to the **root** — everyone re-renders",
            "Signal 2: context would re-render the whole tree on every tick",
            "Signal 3: re-render only when `state.cart.total` changes",
            "Signal 4: written from a websocket handler, interceptor, service worker",
            "Signal 5: a serialized action log you can replay in DevTools"
          ],
          "style": "star",
          "ink": "blue"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "2. Mechanism",
          "ink": "blue"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "js",
          "lines": [
            "let state = { total: 0 }",
            "const subs = new Set()",
            "const set = (n) => {",
            "  state = n; subs.forEach(f => f())",
            "}",
            "// component side:",
            "useSyncExternalStore(",
            "  s => (subs.add(s),",
            "    () => subs.delete(s)),",
            "  () => state.total)"
          ],
          "note": "selector runs on every notify"
        },
        {
          "type": "diagram",
          "kind": "flow",
          "spec": {
            "nodes": [
              {
                "text": "module object",
                "sub": "lives outside tree"
              },
              {
                "text": "subscriber Set",
                "sub": "add / delete"
              },
              {
                "text": "notify()",
                "sub": "on every write"
              },
              {
                "text": "useSyncExternalStore",
                "sub": "re-render if slice changed",
                "ink": "green"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "style": "sticky",
          "title": "The real lesson",
          "text": "Most \"we need Redux\" is a ==server cache== ({icon:react} Query) plus **two** contexts. Try that first."
        }
      ],
      "hero": "react",
      "subtitle": "Five signals"
    },
