      "page_title": "Store Libraries Compared",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "3. Comparison",
          "ink": "purple"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "headers": [
            "Tool",
            "Model",
            "Cost"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "Redux Toolkit",
              "slices + Immer",
              "heaviest, DevTools"
            ],
            [
              "Zustand",
              "`useStore(s=>s.cart)`",
              "no provider"
            ],
            [
              "Jotai / Recoil",
              "atoms, bottom-up",
              "derived auto"
            ],
            [
              "MobX",
              "observable proxy",
              "tracks reads"
            ],
            [
              "TanStack Query",
              "**server cache**",
              "not a store"
            ]
          ],
          "highlightRow": 4,
          "frame": "solid"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Redux: one store, middleware, a named action per change",
            "Zustand: hook store, selector arg, near-zero boilerplate",
            "Jotai: many small atoms; derived atoms __recompute__ themselves",
            "MobX: re-render comes from ==proxy reads==, not from setState",
            "Query/SWR: staleness, dedupe, refetch, retry — server data only"
          ],
          "style": "dot"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "4. Example",
          "ink": "orange"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "js",
          "lines": [
            "// zustand: only total re-renders",
            "const total = useCart(",
            "  s => s.items.reduce(",
            "    (n,i)=>n+i.price, 0))",
            "// outside React, no hook:",
            "socket.on('px', p =>",
            "  useCart.getState().set(p))"
          ],
          "note": "selector result compared by Object.is"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "5. Summary",
          "ink": "green"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Store costs an extra ==mental model== the whole team carries",
            "Indirection on every read: where did this value come from?",
            "Lint rules only help if the team actually follows them",
            "Reach for it when 2+ signals fire, not when one does"
          ],
          "style": "checkbox",
          "ink": "green"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "1. What an Effect Is For",
          "ink": "green"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Effects ==synchronize with external systems== — network, DOM, sockets, timers",
            "**Not** for computing values from other state — compute during render",
            "No external system involved? You probably need no effect",
            "Rule: ask __what outside React am I syncing with?__"
          ],
          "style": "dot",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "green"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "2. Mechanism: fetch-in-useEffect",
          "ink": "blue"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "jsx",
          "lines": [
            "useEffect(() => {",
            "  let ignore = false        // race fix",
            "  fetch(url).then(r => r.json())",
            "   .then(d => { if (!ignore) setD(d) })",
            "  return () => { ignore = true }",
            "}, [url])"
          ],
          "note": "cleanup flips ignore on url change"
        }
      ],
      "hero": "react",
      "subtitle": "Five signals"
