            "One ==god context== for auth + theme + cart: one flag flips the whole app",
            "`useCallback` everywhere while children are not `React.memo` — pure overhead"
          ],
          "style": "cross"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "js",
          "lines": [
            "// isLoading && isError = ???",
            "status: 'idle' | 'loading'",
            "      | 'success' | 'error'"
          ],
          "note": "union kills impossible combos"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "6. Worked Example: The Fix",
          "ink": "green"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "jsx",
          "lines": [
            "function Cart({ userId }) {",
            "  const [items,setItems]=useState([])",
            "  const count = items.length   // derive",
            "  const empty = count === 0    // derive",
            "  const timer = useRef(null)   // no render",
            "}"
          ],
          "note": "one state, two derived, one ref"
        },
        {
