        {
          "type": "sidebox",
          "title": "Redux for server data",
          "items": [
            "Actions + reducers to hold a `GET /users` response",
            "You hand-write cache, dedupe, refetch, invalidation",
            "A ==query library== gives all four free",
            "Keep the store for real {purple:client} state"
