          "ink": "orange"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "style": "takeaway",
          "title": "One rule behind all twelve",
          "text": "Every value has __one__ home. Ask: can I compute it? Then it is not state. Does it re-render? Then it is not a ref."
        },
